I'm telling her you said that.


00:14:42.783 --> 00:14:44.352
<i>Do not tell her I said that.</i>
I am.


00:14:44.493 --> 00:14:45.766
<i>You know I'm terrified of her.</i>


00:14:45.911 --> 00:14:47.230
That's why I'm telling her.


00:15:37.171 --> 00:15:38.410
Bingo.


00:15:40.215 --> 00:15:43.741
<i>Hey, guys.
It's me, May. This is May Sings the Blues.</i>


00:15:43.886 --> 00:15:45.918
<i>I'm a struggling
singer-songwriter</i>


00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:47.252
<i>who still remembers
the good old days</i>


00:15:47.264 --> 00:15:49.046
<i>when we could still
listen to music all together.</i>


00:15:49.058 --> 00:15:50.923
<i>So, you can make any requests</i>


00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:53.175
<i>and you can hit "like"
if you like what you hear</i>


00:15:53.312 --> 00:15:55.382
<i>and maybe even subscribe.</i>


00:15:55.773 --> 00:15:56.921
So, what's next?


00:15:57.066 --> 00:15:59.090
<i>Let's lighten the mood
a little bit.</i>


00:15:59.234 --> 00:16:03.886
<i>Vanilla Ice? No,
that's the wrong stream, buddy.</i>


00:16:07.868 --> 00:16:10.400
MDO0239 says,


00:16:10.412 --> 00:16:11.985
<i>"I remember you
played a great cover"</i>


00:16:11.997 --> 00:16:13.486
<i>"of American Pie once."</i>


00:16:13.624 --> 00:16:18.652
"Your songs got me through some
rough days when I was in the military."


00:16:26.345 --> 00:16:28.460
Well, MD,


00:16:28.597 --> 00:16:30.541
this one is for you
and the boys.


00:16:31.892 --> 00:16:36.010
<i>Take a deep breath,
everything will be all right.</i>


00:16:36.146 --> 00:16:39.843
<i>Leave your fears
On the battlefield.</i>


00:16:39.984 --> 00:16:43.100
<i>Find your strength
and let it take the wheel.</i>


00:16:43.237 --> 00:16:47.514
<i>Take a deep breath,
everything will be all right.</i>


00:16:47.658 --> 00:16:51.685
<i>One step back,
Two steps forward.</i>


00:16:51.829 --> 00:16:54.354
<i>And the beat of your heart
gets stronger.</i>


00:16:54.498 --> 00:16:57.569
<i>One step back,
Two steps forward...</i>


00:17:20.232 --> 00:17:22.552
Ooh, ooh!


00:17:24.695 --> 00:17:27.390
<i>You still got it.
I see you.</i>


00:17:42.337 --> 00:17:44.532
Got a special
delivery for Miss Garcia.


00:17:47.301 --> 00:17:48.790
Hey, stranger.


00:17:52.848 --> 00:17:54.755
<i>UV sanitation complete.</i>


00:17:54.767 --> 00:17:56.666
<i>Package is successfully prepped.</i>


00:18:00.522 --> 00:18:04.344
"Roses are red,
violets are blue,"


00:18:05.486 --> 00:18:07.510
"but I can't get those
in this screwed-up world,"


00:18:07.654 --> 00:18:09.553
"so here's some pencils
for you."


00:18:12.367 --> 00:18:14.391
You stole them,
Nicholas James.


00:18:14.536 --> 00:18:16.355
<i>How did I steal 'em?
There's nobody around.</i>


00:18:16.497 --> 00:18:18.236
<i>They're just sitting there,
but if you don't want 'em...</i>


00:18:18.248 --> 00:18:20.363
No, no. Give me, give me,
give me, give me, please.


00:18:20.375 --> 00:18:22.024
<i>All right,
I'm putting 'em in.</i>


00:18:24.421 --> 00:18:26.445
<i>UV sanitation complete.</i>


00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:28.034
Oh, my God.


00:18:31.887 --> 00:18:33.661
I could kiss you right now.


00:18:34.473 --> 00:18:37.464
<i>Yeah, well, someday.</i>


00:18:39.269 --> 00:18:43.091
<i>The way I figure, by the time
I'm 87 and you're, what is it, 84,</i>


00:18:43.232 --> 00:18:44.926
<i>we should have
enough put away...</i>


00:18:45.067 --> 00:18:47.060
Shut up.
<i>...to buy passes and get out of the city.</i>


00:18:47.194 --> 00:18:48.467
<i>I'm serious.</i>


00:18:49.321 --> 00:18:51.186
<i>It's a dream.</i>


00:18:52.908 --> 00:18:55.228
<i>Oh, shit, Lester's calling me.</i>


00:18:55.369 --> 00:18:56.688
<i>I'm gonna add him in.</i>


00:18:59.248 --> 00:19:00.988
<i>What's up, boss?</i>


00:19:01.125 --> 00:19:02.447
What the hell are you doing?


00:19:02.459 --> 00:19:03.732
Don't you have somewhere to be?


00:19:03.836 --> 00:19:06.031
<i>Like a high-priority drop
on the Westside?</i>


00:19:06.171 --> 00:19:07.694
<i>I'm on it.
Say hi to Sara.</i>


00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:09.034
Hey, Lester.


00:19:09.174 --> 00:19:11.244
<i>Stop distracting
my best courier.</i>


00:19:11.385 --> 00:19:12.999
<i>Whoa, whoa, whoa,
wait, wait, wait.</i>


00:19:13.011 --> 00:19:14.251
<i>Did you just say,
"best courier"?</i>


00:19:14.263 --> 00:19:16.708
<i>Slip of the tongue.
Now get going.</i>


00:19:19.643 --> 00:19:20.916
<i>Well, you heard the man.</i>


00:19:21.061 --> 00:19:22.926
<i>I gotta get going.</i>
Yep.


00:19:25.107 --> 00:19:26.801
<i>I'll call you tonight?</i>


00:19:26.942 --> 00:19:28.974
I don't know.
I think I have to check my busy schedule,


00:19:28.986 --> 00:19:31.181
but I think I can make it work.


00:19:48.922 --> 00:19:51.287
<i>User MD donated $100.</i>


00:20:22.831 --> 00:20:24.775
Well, buckle up.


00:20:24.917 --> 00:20:28.068
Yeah, I'm gonna call you.


00:20:38.013 --> 00:20:39.582
<i>Hey, MD?</i>


00:20:40.349 --> 00:20:42.669
Uh, D... Dozer.


00:20:42.809 --> 00:20:43.957
<i>Like a bulldozer?</i>


00:20:44.102 --> 00:20:47.673
<i>Uh, like Michael Dozer.</i>


00:20:48.649 --> 00:20:50.593
Hey, Michael.


00:20:50.734 --> 00:20:52.678
I'm May.
It's nice to meet you.


00:20:52.819 --> 00:20:54.843
No, I know you're...
You're May.


00:20:56.615 --> 00:20:59.106
<i>You miss if, Dozer,
the way things were?</i>


00:21:00.702 --> 00:21:02.317
I was on lockdown


00:21:02.329 --> 00:21:04.148
long before it was fashionable.


00:21:05.415 --> 00:21:06.734
<i>How come?</i>


00:21:08.585 --> 00:21:10.617
<i>When I got back from the war,</i>


00:21:10.629 --> 00:21:11.952
<i>people didn't want
to talk about it.</i>


00:21:11.964 --> 00:21:13.908
<i>You're a vet in a wheelchair,
people are...</i>


00:21:14.049 --> 00:21:16.369
They see you, they put their
face right in their phones.


00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:18.863
They don't want to...
They don't want to have to face that.


00:21:21.098 --> 00:21:23.839
Somewhere down the line,
I just


00:21:25.185 --> 00:21:26.583
stopped going out.


00:21:28.397 --> 00:21:29.670
For how long?


00:21:30.315 --> 00:21:31.884
<i>It's, uh...</i>


00:21:33.193 --> 00:21:34.967
<i>It's coming up on six years.</i>


00:21:36.697 --> 00:21:39.848
<i>Wow. You're a pro
at lockdowns.</i>


00:21:39.992 --> 00:21:42.517
This must be a cakewalk for you.


00:21:42.661 --> 00:21:46.528
<i>I don't know about a cakewalk,
for anybody, but</i>


00:21:46.665 --> 00:21:50.282
<i>having Max... I mean,
Max here is my eyes and ears.</i>


00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:53.319
<i>Hey, Max.</i>


00:21:53.463 --> 00:21:55.783
<i>Is it as bad as it seems
out there?</i>


00:21:57.551 --> 00:21:59.871
It's worse.
It's way worse.


00:22:00.012 --> 00:22:02.707
<i>But it pays the bills.</i>


00:22:04.433 --> 00:22:07.925
<i>$3,000.
It might as well have been 3 million.</i>


00:22:09.104 --> 00:22:11.174
<i>What's the matter
with you tonight?</i>


00:22:11.315 --> 00:22:13.339
<i>You look like
you lost your last friend.</i>


00:22:13.483 --> 00:22:14.722
<i>How'd you like to go to...</i>


00:22:14.860 --> 00:22:16.509
I feel like I'm at the theater.


00:22:16.653 --> 00:22:19.519
Yeah, you kinda
have to squint a little,


00:22:19.656 --> 00:22:22.522
but, I mean, it's basically
like Mann's Chinese out here.


00:22:22.993 --> 00:22:24.190
Hmm.


00:22:24.202 --> 00:22:25.976
That was my favorite one.


00:22:26.121 --> 00:22:28.816
You know I used to go there
every Friday for matinees, right?


00:22:30.167 --> 00:22:33.613
Do you think that maybe we
were there for the same showings?


00:22:33.754 --> 00:22:37.530
I did remember seeing this really
hot girl that I was too scared to talk to.


00:22:38.133 --> 00:22:40.248
You're full of shit.


00:22:40.385 --> 00:22:42.750
<i>Where did you get the projector?</i>


00:22:42.888 --> 00:22:44.628
<i>Another score
from the old office.</i>


00:22:44.765 --> 00:22:47.381
You really emptied
that place out, huh?


00:22:47.517 --> 00:22:49.917
Oh, there's nothing left.
Everything's here.


00:22:50.062 --> 00:22:52.177
I could make a law firm
out of my house right now.


00:22:52.314 --> 00:22:55.931
I have paper, paper clips,
binders, highlighters, a hole punch.


00:22:56.068 --> 00:22:58.217
I have a fax machine.
A fax machine?


00:22:58.362 --> 00:22:59.760
<i>Yeah, my mom would be proud.</i>


00:22:59.905 --> 00:23:01.698
<i>She always said I'd
end up running the joint.</i>


00:23:03.116 --> 00:23:04.981
Can you see that?


00:23:05.118 --> 00:23:06.316
<i>There'll
be thousands of dollars there.</i>


00:23:06.328 --> 00:23:08.272
Actually, now that
you mention it,


00:23:08.413 --> 00:23:11.112
would you mind telling the guy in
front if he could please remove his hat?


00:23:11.124 --> 00:23:12.522
<i>This guy right here?</i>


00:23:16.129 --> 00:23:17.243
<i>Is that better?</i>


00:23:17.923 --> 00:23:21.074
Hey, Lita, you wanna
watch with us?


00:23:37.401 --> 00:23:40.114
Go back to your
room and I'll bring you medicine, okay?


00:23:45.534 --> 00:23:46.682
Is she sick?


00:23:51.248 --> 00:23:52.404
<i>Stay in your homes.
We are here to help.</i>


00:23:52.416 --> 00:23:54.864
<i>Stay in your homes.
We are here to help.</i>


00:23:54.876 --> 00:23:57.526
<i>Please remain in your homes.</i>


00:23:57.671 --> 00:24:00.787
<i>Your safety is our priority.</i>


00:24:01.675 --> 00:24:04.826
<i>If you attempt to leave your home,
you will be shot on sight.</i>


00:24:09.641 --> 00:24:11.210
<i>Please remain in your homes.</i>


00:24:11.351 --> 00:24:13.796
What are you doing here?
Who's asking?


00:24:13.937 --> 00:24:15.593
<i>Lockdown is still in effect.</i>


00:24:15.605 --> 00:24:19.506
I am Emmett D. Harland,
Department of Sanitation.


00:24:31.663 --> 00:24:33.152
Sara, what's going on?


00:24:35.792 --> 00:24:39.068
I got out of Q-zone today.
I... I'm clean.


00:24:39.963 --> 00:24:41.031
What are you doing?


00:24:41.173 --> 00:24:42.913
Just bring it in.


00:24:43.049 --> 00:24:44.618
Get away from me!


00:24:48.096 --> 00:24:52.248
DOS is on-site. Standing down.
Heading to next callout. Over.


00:24:59.566 --> 00:25:01.389
Department of Sanitation,
open up!


00:25:01.401 --> 00:25:02.640
Shh.


00:25:05.322 --> 00:25:07.016
Break it in, guys.


00:25:07.157 --> 00:25:09.227
Hey, guys, guys!


00:25:09.367 --> 00:25:11.107
It's the wrong apartment.


00:25:13.246 --> 00:25:16.817
<i>I said 3-2, 32.
Can you read?</i>


00:25:18.084 --> 00:25:19.573
<i>Department of Sanitation.</i>


00:25:19.711 --> 00:25:21.451
<i>They're coming for Alice.</i>


00:25:21.588 --> 00:25:23.612
<i>Just break it down.</i>


00:25:23.757 --> 00:25:26.077
<i>Mrs. Grant.</i>


00:25:27.344 --> 00:25:31.371
<i>Alice and William Grant?
This is the Department of Sanitation.</i>


00:25:31.515 --> 00:25:34.711
<i>By the power granted to me
by the City of Los Angeles,</i>


00:25:34.851 --> 00:25:38.127
<i>I hereby detain you
under the ordinance 312</i>


00:25:38.271 --> 00:25:41.547
<i>for immediate transport
to the Q-zone.</i>


00:25:43.235 --> 00:25:45.885
Sara, it's me!


00:25:46.029 --> 00:25:47.644
Sara, do not open that door.


00:25:49.324 --> 00:25:50.893
Do not open that door.


00:25:52.619 --> 00:25:54.234
I'm coming over right now.


00:25:55.163 --> 00:25:57.608
<i>Please! Please help me!</i>


00:25:57.749 --> 00:25:59.022
<i>Nico, please hurry.</i>


00:26:02.963 --> 00:26:04.782
Stop! No! Please!


00:26:06.883 --> 00:26:09.874
Somebody help me, please!
Somebody help me!


00:26:10.011 --> 00:26:11.250
Get off me!


00:26:19.104 --> 00:26:21.219
Somebody, please!


00:26:28.029 --> 00:26:29.973
<i>I know you're in there.</i>


00:26:34.828 --> 00:26:35.976
Hello.


00:26:36.121 --> 00:26:38.566
<i>Are you Ms. Garcia?</i>


00:26:40.166 --> 00:26:43.191
<i>I'm terribly sorry to inform you</i>


00:26:43.336 --> 00:26:46.452
<i>that there's been an outbreak
of cases in this building,</i>


00:26:46.590 --> 00:26:48.284
<i>including your poor neighbor.</i>


00:26:48.425 --> 00:26:50.244
<i>Have you ever left
your apartment?</i>


00:26:50.385 --> 00:26:53.331
<i>Maybe a glass of wine
with, uh, Mrs. Grant?</i>


00:26:53.722 --> 00:26:56.213
<i>Like, a little gossip?
A little talk?</i>


00:26:56.349 --> 00:26:58.248
<i>Breaking the lockdown?</i>


00:26:59.978 --> 00:27:02.093
No, we follow the rules here.


00:27:02.230 --> 00:27:06.632
<i>You wouldn't believe how many
times I've gotten that answer.</i>


00:27:06.776 --> 00:27:10.347
<i>And before you know it,
I'm back at the same address.</i>


00:27:10.488 --> 00:27:11.761
<i>That's...</i>


00:27:11.906 --> 00:27:13.429
<i>Yeah, you know, it's...</i>


00:27:13.575 --> 00:27:20.105
<i>Disobedience is, like,
spreading like a tornado.</i>


00:27:20.874 --> 00:27:23.365
<i>Well, don't forget your
TempCheck in the morning.</i>


00:27:23.501 --> 00:27:26.993
<i>And remember,
stay safe, sane and sanitized.</i>


00:28:10.882 --> 00:28:13.407
No! No, you have to
stay away from me.


00:28:16.680 --> 00:28:18.593
Please,
just let me help you, okay?


00:28:30.527 --> 00:28:32.426
For all we know,
it's just a cold, Lita.


00:28:34.489 --> 00:28:37.605
No, Sara,
stay away from me.


00:28:47.252 --> 00:28:49.242
<i>Hey, I just got here.
How is she?</i>


00:28:49.796 --> 00:28:50.829
She's not good.


00:28:51.339 --> 00:28:52.453
<i>She has a fever.</i>


00:28:52.590 --> 00:28:54.364
Oh, shit.


00:28:59.472 --> 00:29:01.542
<i>Temp test
is at 9:00 a.m., Nico.</i>


00:29:04.811 --> 00:29:06.050
Okay.


00:29:07.731 --> 00:29:10.096
They'll take us both.
You know that, right?


00:29:11.901 --> 00:29:13.720
They'll take both her and me.


00:29:14.988 --> 00:29:16.056
Sara...


00:29:17.615 --> 00:29:18.683
<i>Hey, hey.</i>


00:29:18.825 --> 00:29:21.099
No one's taking you from me.


00:29:26.666 --> 00:29:29.282
She needs me. You should go,
okay? It's not safe here.


00:29:29.878 --> 00:29:30.911
Yeah, right.


00:29:35.467 --> 00:29:36.865
I'm not going anywhere.


00:29:38.136 --> 00:29:39.409
Thank you.


00:29:53.943 --> 00:29:55.842
Breaking curfew?
Oh, Jesus.


00:30:03.620 --> 00:30:05.644
Harland needs to see me.


00:30:05.789 --> 00:30:07.654
Oh, does he?
Yeah.


00:30:07.791 --> 00:30:09.235
Mm.


00:30:09.834 --> 00:30:12.529
He has those passes
that we need.


00:30:13.046 --> 00:30:14.319
Mmm.


00:30:17.801 --> 00:30:19.871
So may I leave?


00:30:21.012 --> 00:30:23.669
You know, every time
you open that door,


00:30:23.681 --> 00:30:26.172
you risk letting in
what's out there.


00:30:26.309 --> 00:30:29.880
Yeah, I know. I also know
that it is the only way


00:30:30.021 --> 00:30:32.216
that we are keeping
a roof over our heads.


00:30:32.357 --> 00:30:34.973
Those are your words,
not mine. Jesus.


00:30:35.985 --> 00:30:38.976
Piper, uh, you think
I want to go out there?


00:30:39.531 --> 00:30:41.225
I think you love it.


00:30:45.161 --> 00:30:48.732
And just because you wear that bracelet,
doesn't make it true.


00:30:48.873 --> 00:30:50.738
So be a good boy


00:30:50.750 --> 00:30:55.368
and burn that sleek
little outfit of yours


00:30:55.505 --> 00:30:58.121
before you come
back into the house.


00:31:22.115 --> 00:31:23.388
Nico?


00:31:26.494 --> 00:31:27.562
Nico?


00:31:29.038 --> 00:31:30.232
I'm here.


00:31:31.249 --> 00:31:32.898
She's sleeping.


00:31:34.752 --> 00:31:36.241
She needs to rest.


00:31:40.842 --> 00:31:43.333
It's like I can feel you
through this door.


00:31:54.063 --> 00:31:55.131
Hey...


00:31:59.611 --> 00:32:01.635
Do you remember
when we first met,


00:32:02.739 --> 00:32:04.433
and you were yelling at me
in Spanish?


00:32:06.576 --> 00:32:08.475
I have no recollection of that.


00:32:09.370 --> 00:32:11.314
I blame Lester's handwriting.


00:32:11.915 --> 00:32:15.987
It said 31,
but I read it as 37,


00:32:16.502 --> 00:32:19.277
and I came pounding on
your door like a jackass.


00:32:23.301 --> 00:32:24.916
Do you ever wonder
what would've happened


00:32:24.928 --> 00:32:27.248
if you knocked
on some other girl's door?


00:32:29.140 --> 00:32:31.380
Well, I knock
on a hundred doors a day.


00:32:38.858 --> 00:32:41.053
But I've never met
anyone like you.


00:32:42.487 --> 00:32:44.852
I'm really glad Lester
messed up that address.


00:32:48.326 --> 00:32:49.770
Yeah, me too.


00:32:58.169 --> 00:32:59.408
Oh, hey, Mom.


00:32:59.545 --> 00:33:01.160
What are you still doing awake?


00:33:01.297 --> 00:33:04.743
I heard voices.
Did Dad leave?


00:33:04.884 --> 00:33:07.955
Yeah, he had to go out,
but he'll be back.


00:33:08.888 --> 00:33:11.709
He shouldn't do that.
It's not safe.


00:33:12.850 --> 00:33:14.624
I know.


00:33:14.769 --> 00:33:19.091
But sometimes we have to do
things we don't want to survive.


00:33:24.779 --> 00:33:25.927
Mom,


00:33:28.199 --> 00:33:30.269
do you ever wish
I was different?


00:33:31.536 --> 00:33:33.901
What? No, sweetie.


00:33:34.038 --> 00:33:35.982
Wha... What do you mean?


00:33:37.834 --> 00:33:40.154
Ellie said
with you being immune,


00:33:40.294 --> 00:33:42.819
there's a 50% chance I would be.


00:33:42.964 --> 00:33:45.034
Oh, honey.
And I'm not.


00:33:46.592 --> 00:33:48.787
Instead, I'm even weaker
than a normal person.


00:33:48.928 --> 00:33:51.453
You are not weak.


00:33:53.182 --> 00:33:55.798
But if I wasn't like this,
you could go places.


00:33:55.935 --> 00:33:57.925
You wouldn't have to
worry about me.


00:33:58.062 --> 00:34:00.511
And why would
I wanna go anywhere


00:34:00.523 --> 00:34:02.092
if you couldn't be with me?


00:34:04.152 --> 00:34:05.220
Listen to me.


00:34:06.612 --> 00:34:08.306
You are perfect.


00:34:08.948 --> 00:34:11.097
Absolutely perfect.


00:34:11.242 --> 00:34:15.860
And I wouldn't change
one thing about you.


00:34:17.957 --> 00:34:19.947
And neither would your father.


00:34:26.466 --> 00:34:29.992
<i>Do you think she knows
she's a killer?</i>


00:34:33.306 --> 00:34:36.548
<i>She's right next to him
And I'm sittin' by myself.</i>


00:34:36.684 --> 00:34:39.254
<i>She's halfway in I think
She loves somebody else.</i>


00:34:40.021 --> 00:34:41.260
<i>Shit.</i>


00:34:43.107 --> 00:34:44.756
<i>But I love her.</i>


00:34:46.903 --> 00:34:51.476
<i>Help, I'm feelin' overwhelmed.</i>


00:34:51.616 --> 00:34:54.732
<i>Can't recognize myself.</i>


00:34:54.869 --> 00:34:58.896
<i>Can you love somebody
If you love somebody else?</i>


00:34:59.040 --> 00:35:01.485
<i>I need some help.</i>


00:35:01.626 --> 00:35:05.152
<i>This aching hurts like hell.</i>


00:35:05.922 --> 00:35:07.616
There she is.


00:35:10.384 --> 00:35:11.657
Hey, baby.


00:35:11.803 --> 00:35:13.998
Do you like what you see?


00:35:16.015 --> 00:35:17.459
Come here.


00:35:17.600 --> 00:35:20.295
Is it worth the risk
coming to see me?


00:35:20.436 --> 00:35:22.210
I guess we'll find out.


00:35:27.652 --> 00:35:29.267
What do you want?


00:35:29.403 --> 00:35:31.177
You know what I really want?


00:35:35.660 --> 00:35:37.479
I don't want this.


00:35:40.873 --> 00:35:42.772
And I don't want this.


00:35:44.919 --> 00:35:46.738
Get this out of the way.


00:35:51.384 --> 00:35:53.875
I want you.
Mmm-hmm.


00:36:55.156 --> 00:36:57.271
It's time
for our temp test, okay?


00:36:58.659 --> 00:36:59.898
Okay.


00:37:00.036 --> 00:37:02.356
I'll go first, okay?
Mmm.


00:37:04.707 --> 00:37:06.322
<i>Virus check in progress.</i>


00:37:07.543 --> 00:37:10.284
<i>Four, three, two, one.</i>


00:37:11.339 --> 00:37:14.205
<i>No virus defected.
Have a great day.</i>


00:37:16.469 --> 00:37:18.994
<i>Virus check in progress.</i>


00:37:20.389 --> 00:37:24.165
<i>Four, three, two, one.</i>


00:37:24.310 --> 00:37:26.004
<i>Virus check has failed.</i>


00:37:28.064 --> 00:37:30.213
<i>A fever has been detected
at your residence.</i>


00:37:33.027 --> 00:37:35.176
<i>Armed guards will be
arriving shortly.</i>


00:37:35.321 --> 00:37:39.518
<i>You must not attempt to leave your
home or you will be apprehended.</i>


00:37:40.701 --> 00:37:43.021
<i>Do not attempt to engage
with armed guards.</i>


00:37:43.162 --> 00:37:45.436
<i>Bribes will not be accepted.</i>


00:37:45.581 --> 00:37:46.862
<i>Your well-being is
our biggest priority.</i>


00:37:46.874 --> 00:37:48.572
It's gonna be okay.
It's gonna be okay.


00:37:48.584 --> 00:37:51.860
<i>Your compliance is mandatory
and appreciated.</i>


00:37:52.004 --> 00:37:53.037
Sara?


00:37:55.216 --> 00:37:56.489
They're coming.


00:37:56.634 --> 00:37:58.658
No, no, they can't.
You're not sick.


00:37:58.803 --> 00:38:02.795
You know how this works, Nico.
If she's sick, I'm sick.


00:38:02.932 --> 00:38:05.457
To hell with the rules, Sara.
Let's just go now.


00:38:07.645 --> 00:38:11.137
Nico, I'm not leaving Lita.


00:38:13.109 --> 00:38:14.678
It's gonna be okay.


00:38:16.696 --> 00:38:18.595
You're going to be okay.


00:38:19.782 --> 00:38:21.271
Sara, I'm not letting
you give up.


00:38:21.909 --> 00:38:24.024
We were never
gonna get out of here.


00:38:27.290 --> 00:38:29.360
I have to let you go, Nico.


00:38:33.587 --> 00:38:35.076
Please say goodbye to me.


00:38:35.214 --> 00:38:37.087
I'm not saying that, Sara.
I'm not saying that!


00:38:37.216 --> 00:38:39.786
Please say goodbye to me.
I'm not saying that!


00:38:39.927 --> 00:38:42.292
I'm gonna get
the immunity passes, today.


00:38:43.514 --> 00:38:44.708
How?


00:38:45.558 --> 00:38:46.591
I'll figure it out.


00:38:46.726 --> 00:38:48.375
I'm coming back, okay?


00:38:48.519 --> 00:38:50.634
I'm coming back for you.
Okay.


00:39:07.288 --> 00:39:09.486
<i>Answer the phone.
Answer the phone.</i>


00:39:09.498 --> 00:39:10.942
<i>Answer the phone.</i>


00:39:11.083 --> 00:39:13.904
<i>Lester, I need
two immunity passes. Now.</i>


00:39:14.045 --> 00:39:15.785
<i>What?</i>


00:39:15.921 --> 00:39:19.037
You think if I had a stash of
immunity cuffs hanging around,


00:39:19.175 --> 00:39:20.790
I'd still be living
in this shithole?


00:39:20.926 --> 00:39:23.075
<i>Lester, please.
They're coming for Sara.</i>


00:39:23.220 --> 00:39:25.335
I have to get her out.


00:39:25.473 --> 00:39:27.129
This is what happens when
you fall in love with a have-not.


00:39:27.141 --> 00:39:28.209
I can't help you.


00:39:28.351 --> 00:39:30.215
<i>This building
is under full quarantine.</i>


00:39:30.227 --> 00:39:32.260
Look, all I need is a lead.
Just give me something.


00:39:36.025 --> 00:39:37.639
You know them packages
you've been running


00:39:37.651 --> 00:39:38.932
<i>on the side for the Griffins...</i>


00:39:38.944 --> 00:39:40.684
<i>Are you shitting me?</i>


00:39:40.696 --> 00:39:41.935
<i>I've been running
black-market cuffs</i>


00:39:41.947 --> 00:39:43.141
<i>and you didn't tell me?</i>


00:39:43.282 --> 00:39:45.852
<i>Nico, listen,
you didn't hear this shit from me.</i>


00:39:45.993 --> 00:39:48.233
That asshole
is my biggest client,


00:39:48.371 --> 00:39:49.894
<i>but he's also a man...</i>
Get lost.


00:39:49.997 --> 00:39:51.320
<i>...you do not
want to mess with.</i>


00:39:51.332 --> 00:39:52.901
Bracelets are 150 G's apiece.


00:39:53.042 --> 00:39:55.032
<i>You better have
the money to back it up.</i>


00:39:55.044 --> 00:39:56.116
<i>I'll figure it out.</i>


00:39:56.128 --> 00:39:57.743
<i>Lockdown is mandatory.</i>


00:39:57.755 --> 00:40:00.029
<i>Noncompliance will be
met with severe...</i>


00:40:05.388 --> 00:40:06.627
Damn, kid.


00:40:39.755 --> 00:40:40.949
<i>Señor</i> Nico.


00:40:49.348 --> 00:40:50.746
How was Harland?


00:40:50.891 --> 00:40:52.289
Nuts.


00:40:52.435 --> 00:40:56.052
Hmm. Uh, passes for
Steve and Gwen are ready.


00:40:56.188 --> 00:40:58.929
Are you sure we can trust them?


00:41:00.192 --> 00:41:02.466
Everyone in my network
is reliable.


00:41:02.611 --> 00:41:04.385
That's not who
I'm worried about.


00:41:04.738 --> 00:41:06.557
What's... What's that
supposed to mean?


00:41:06.824 --> 00:41:08.518
A courier is here.


00:41:08.659 --> 00:41:10.899
Says he needs to speak
with you, Mr. Griffin.


00:41:11.036 --> 00:41:12.275
Courier?


00:41:12.872 --> 00:41:14.487
Thank you, Marie.


00:41:17.168 --> 00:41:18.487
Yeah, Nico.


00:41:18.627 --> 00:41:19.866
Mr. Griffin?


00:41:20.129 --> 00:41:21.618
Yeah, what do you want?


00:41:22.089 --> 00:41:24.830
<i>I would never normally do this,
but it's an emergency.</i>


00:41:26.385 --> 00:41:29.501
<i>I need two of these.
I heard maybe you can help me.</i>


00:41:32.099 --> 00:41:33.247
<i>Mr. Griffin?</i>


00:41:33.392 --> 00:41:35.541
1... I don't know
what to tell you, kid.


00:41:35.686 --> 00:41:40.054
I... I can't get those any
more than anybody else can.


00:41:40.191 --> 00:41:41.931
Look, Mr. Griffin,
I have 13 grand.


00:41:42.067 --> 00:41:44.140
<i>I know that's nowhere
near enough, but it's all I...</i>


00:41:50.493 --> 00:41:52.062
How does he know about us?


00:41:52.203 --> 00:41:53.647
I don't know.


00:41:53.787 --> 00:41:55.527
Who've you been
shooting your mouth off to?


00:41:55.664 --> 00:41:57.446
I haven't been shooting
my mouth off to anyone.


00:41:57.458 --> 00:42:02.201
Why don't you ask your...
Your network, 'cause it's so "reliable"?


00:42:02.338 --> 00:42:05.412
Do I need I remind you
what happens to us...


00:42:05.424 --> 00:42:07.494
No... if people find
out what we're doing?


00:42:07.635 --> 00:42:09.875
We go to jail, or even worse...
You do not. I know.


00:42:10.012 --> 00:42:11.911
...we get thrown into
the Q-zone. Really?


00:42:12.056 --> 00:42:13.750
And then what happens to Emma?


00:42:14.934 --> 00:42:18.176
Piper, I told the kid
to go away.


00:42:18.312 --> 00:42:20.086
What else do you want me to do?


00:42:20.231 --> 00:42:21.971
I'd like to know
how he knows about us.


00:42:22.107 --> 00:42:24.181
Well, why don't you do it?
Why don't you find out?


00:42:24.193 --> 00:42:27.560
I'm so sick of
cleaning up your shit.


00:42:27.696 --> 00:42:29.811
Uh, Nico?
<i>Mrs. Griffin?</i>


00:42:29.949 --> 00:42:32.349
I think my husband
is just being extra cautious,


00:42:32.493 --> 00:42:34.062
but I think I can help you.


00:42:35.079 --> 00:42:36.227
Thank you, Mrs. Griffin.


00:42:36.372 --> 00:42:40.945
Hey, listen, um, who...
Who told you about us?


00:42:41.835 --> 00:42:43.779
<i>Nobody. Nobody told me.</i>


00:42:43.921 --> 00:42:45.369
I just... I had nowhere to go,
so I came here.


00:42:45.381 --> 00:42:46.870
I figured you guys
had connections.


00:42:49.385 --> 00:42:52.206
Um, listen, we don't have
what you're looking for,


00:42:52.346 --> 00:42:55.462
but, um, I know
someone who does.


00:42:56.183 --> 00:42:57.547
Marie.


00:42:57.685 --> 00:42:59.678
Can I give you what I have?
It's... It's not much.


00:43:04.233 --> 00:43:05.552
I don't need your money.


00:43:06.819 --> 00:43:09.685
<i>UV sanitation activated.</i>


00:43:09.822 --> 00:43:12.517
<i>Mrs. Griffin, you have
no idea how much this means.</i>


00:43:12.658 --> 00:43:14.602
<i>Thank you,
and you're saving a life.</i>


00:43:24.545 --> 00:43:26.194
<i>It's not done yet.</i>


00:43:26.505 --> 00:43:28.328
I have a lead.
I'm on my way there now. How's Lita?


00:43:28.340 --> 00:43:31.411
She's not good.
There's armed guards outside my door.


00:43:31.552 --> 00:43:33.584
<i>Do not attempt
to leave your home.</i>


00:43:33.596 --> 00:43:35.544
I'll call you when I have the passes.
Just be ready, okay?


00:43:35.556 --> 00:43:36.704
Okay.


00:43:52.781 --> 00:43:53.814
Sara.


00:45:29.336 --> 00:45:30.484
Hello?


00:45:36.218 --> 00:45:37.251
Hello?


00:45:37.386 --> 00:45:39.501
<i>Maria.</i>


00:45:39.638 --> 00:45:45.292
<i>Maria.</i>


00:46:00.701 --> 00:46:03.021
It's like La Scala in Milan.


00:46:04.288 --> 00:46:05.607
You see,
in this country,


00:46:05.748 --> 00:46:08.899
most people think
that Puccini is a mushroom.


00:46:09.376 --> 00:46:10.899
You want a smoke?


00:46:11.044 --> 00:46:12.943
No, I don't smoke.


00:46:13.088 --> 00:46:15.328
Do you know what
I love about smoking?


00:46:15.883 --> 00:46:20.251
It's nice to know there's something
out there that still can kill you.


00:46:24.767 --> 00:46:28.168
Now, a little bird came flying,
landed on my shoulder,


00:46:28.312 --> 00:46:32.805
whispered in my ear
that you need two passes.


00:46:33.400 --> 00:46:34.844
Yeah.


00:46:35.819 --> 00:46:37.013
Follow me.


00:46:43.410 --> 00:46:49.234
Don't worry, I'm a regular guy like you,
just trying to make a living.


00:46:49.374 --> 00:46:51.193
You're a munie, right?


00:46:51.335 --> 00:46:54.861
So I assume these passes,
they're not for you?


00:46:55.464 --> 00:46:58.114
No, my girl's grandma got sick.


00:46:58.258 --> 00:47:00.578
Let's start
with the girl. Age?


00:47:01.094 --> 00:47:02.288
Twenty-six.


00:47:02.429 --> 00:47:04.920
Her full name
and social, please?


00:47:09.353 --> 00:47:10.626
I need a name,


00:47:11.772 --> 00:47:13.716
because I have to
program these passes.


00:47:13.857 --> 00:47:14.971
You... You with me?


00:47:16.527 --> 00:47:17.971
Sara.


00:47:18.737 --> 00:47:20.886
I need her full name.


00:47:22.115 --> 00:47:25.398
I get it. You gotta be cautious
and you gotta be smart,


00:47:25.410 --> 00:47:27.104
especially these days,
you know.


00:47:27.246 --> 00:47:30.067
I didn't set up this meeting.
You did.


00:47:31.208 --> 00:47:33.733
And I'm here wasting
my goddamn time.


00:47:33.877 --> 00:47:35.400
If you don't trust me, leave.


00:47:36.338 --> 00:47:37.486
No.


00:47:38.215 --> 00:47:39.248
I'm good.


00:47:39.383 --> 00:47:40.872
You good?


00:47:42.177 --> 00:47:48.001
You know, we're kinda lucky
because we're two munies.


00:47:48.559 --> 00:47:50.003
I gave you my word.


00:47:50.644 --> 00:47:53.294
And I would like to back it up


00:47:53.438 --> 00:47:54.586
the old-fashioned way.


00:47:58.443 --> 00:47:59.966
What do you say?


00:48:04.741 --> 00:48:05.809
Good.


00:48:05.951 --> 00:48:07.395
Feels good, doesn't it?


00:48:07.536 --> 00:48:09.526
It's like a childhood memory.


00:48:10.372 --> 00:48:13.067
A bite out of Grandma's cookies.


00:48:14.001 --> 00:48:15.820
So I need the name of the girl,


00:48:15.961 --> 00:48:19.737
and I need the name of whoever
knows about this meeting.


00:48:19.882 --> 00:48:21.280
Do you understand?


00:48:22.843 --> 00:48:26.540
And I can stick as many holes
in you as I like.


00:48:32.227 --> 00:48:35.252
Guards! Just go in!


00:49:27.407 --> 00:49:29.147
Get on the ground!


00:49:34.665 --> 00:49:36.109
Come on!


00:49:43.340 --> 00:49:44.829
What's your name, soldier?
Nico.


00:49:44.967 --> 00:49:47.287
Nico, Boomer.
Why are you even helping me?


00:49:47.427 --> 00:49:49.900
They drag and pull schmucks
like you down here to their death.


00:49:50.013 --> 00:49:51.912
Today, I'm drawing
aline in the sand.


00:49:52.975 --> 00:49:54.464
I like you, bro.


00:49:55.102 --> 00:49:57.502
One dead body down here
stinks up the whole building.


00:49:57.646 --> 00:50:00.091
Once you get that smell
in your nostrils, it lingers.


00:50:00.232 --> 00:50:01.426
You can't blow it out.


00:50:01.775 --> 00:50:03.640
Tired of it, man.
No more.


00:50:03.777 --> 00:50:05.471
Over here!
Shit!


00:50:44.401 --> 00:50:45.434
What are you doing?


00:50:45.569 --> 00:50:47.343
I'm staying.


00:50:47.487 --> 00:50:50.137
Head downstairs.
That'll get you back to the elevators.


00:50:52.951 --> 00:50:55.225
Stay safe, pilgrim.
I'm rooting for ya.


00:50:55.787 --> 00:50:57.686
Come on!


00:51:04.588 --> 00:51:06.282
Oh, jeez.


00:51:06.965 --> 00:51:08.739
How hard can it be, guys?


00:51:12.220 --> 00:51:13.414
Hey!


00:51:16.641 --> 00:51:18.798
<i>Answer the phone.
Answer the phone.</i>


00:51:18.810 --> 00:51:20.379
<i>Answer the phone.
Answer the...</i>


00:51:20.604 --> 00:51:21.843
Lester's Gets.


00:51:21.980 --> 00:51:24.926
Distribution...
Cut the crap. Where is he?


00:51:25.067 --> 00:51:26.465
Who are we talking about now?


00:51:26.610 --> 00:51:28.475
Your courier, Nico.


00:51:28.612 --> 00:51:30.477
He showed up here at my house


00:51:30.614 --> 00:51:33.230
and he accused me of
selling black-market passes.


00:51:34.326 --> 00:51:36.350
<i>Well, he's not working today.</i>


00:51:36.495 --> 00:51:38.895
Don't bullshit me, Lester.
I... I know you sit there


00:51:39.039 --> 00:51:41.655
and watch your guys drive
around all day like rats in a maze.


00:51:41.792 --> 00:51:45.318
Just give me his GPS or I'm
gonna take my business elsewhere.


00:51:48.673 --> 00:51:52.040
He, uh... looks like
he disabled his GPS.


00:51:52.177 --> 00:51:54.247
<i>I'll let you know
if he comes back online.</i>


00:51:54.846 --> 00:51:56.210
Yeah, you do that.


00:51:57.974 --> 00:51:59.042
So?


00:51:59.559 --> 00:52:01.253
He slipped the leash.


00:52:01.686 --> 00:52:03.926
What do we pay Harland for?


00:52:04.064 --> 00:52:05.804
He better get this contained.


00:52:05.941 --> 00:52:07.009
Yeah.


00:52:08.652 --> 00:52:11.598
<i>So, it was pre-pandemic,
and I met this record exec online,</i>


00:52:11.738 --> 00:52:13.728
and he saw one of my
YouTube videos,


00:52:13.740 --> 00:52:14.938
and he invited me out here,


00:52:14.950 --> 00:52:16.940
<i>and he told me that
I was gonna be a big star,</i>


00:52:17.327 --> 00:52:21.649
and then all the shit hit,
and I got trapped here.


00:52:21.957 --> 00:52:25.403
<i>And the record deal that
never existed now was gone.</i>


00:52:25.544 --> 00:52:26.783
<i>It was never gonna happen.</i>


00:52:26.920 --> 00:52:29.411
He keeps doing
this weird dance with me


00:52:29.548 --> 00:52:31.538
like somehow things
are gonna be different,


00:52:31.675 --> 00:52:35.121
or somehow things are gonna be
the way that they were, but the...


00:52:35.262 --> 00:52:38.162
<i>You know that nothing...
Nothing is ever gonna be the same.</i>


00:52:39.599 --> 00:52:41.248
<i>And I'm lonely, you know?</i>


00:52:44.688 --> 00:52:47.053
Well, this is nice
and light conversation.


00:52:47.190 --> 00:52:49.430
<i>You know what I mean?</i>


00:52:49.568 --> 00:52:52.016
I don't know why
I'm telling you all this.


00:52:56.366 --> 00:52:57.935
What's the matter?


00:52:58.076 --> 00:53:00.146
<i>Are you okay?
What's going on?</i> Nothing.


00:53:07.335 --> 00:53:08.654
<i>Is it that guy?</i>


00:53:08.795 --> 00:53:10.614
The suit you were
telling me about?


00:53:11.256 --> 00:53:13.030
You gonna save me, Dozer?


00:53:13.800 --> 00:53:16.996
I... I don't know if you're kidding or not.
Do you need saving? Do you...


00:53:17.304 --> 00:53:19.999
<i>'Cause I'll come over there.</i>
No, it's okay.


00:53:20.849 --> 00:53:22.748
If you got it,
you got it.


00:53:23.476 --> 00:53:26.251
No, um, I'm gonna handle it.


00:53:27.731 --> 00:53:30.176
<i>Are you sure?</i>
I'm gonna handle it.


00:53:39.910 --> 00:53:41.104
Hey.


00:53:42.329 --> 00:53:43.568
Hi.


00:53:46.082 --> 00:53:47.446
What is it?


00:53:49.920 --> 00:53:51.193
She's gone.


00:53:57.928 --> 00:54:00.077
Please tell me
you have the passes.


00:54:06.019 --> 00:54:07.292
I don't.


00:54:08.980 --> 00:54:10.469
I don't have the passes.


