do any of us have if we get this thing?


00:57:07.909 --> 00:57:09.398
I want you out.


00:57:09.536 --> 00:57:11.401
Give me the gun.


00:57:11.538 --> 00:57:13.403
Piper, I don't have time for this.
Give me...


00:57:13.540 --> 00:57:16.110
You let her tape you?
You dumb prick.


00:57:16.251 --> 00:57:19.151
Give me the gun,
let me clean up my mess.


00:57:19.295 --> 00:57:21.865
You want me to clean it up?
Give me the gun.


00:57:23.925 --> 00:57:25.119
I want you out.


00:57:25.260 --> 00:57:27.625
What are you gonna do?
You... You gonna shoot me?


00:57:27.762 --> 00:57:29.536
Get out!


00:57:32.016 --> 00:57:33.380
Get out.


00:58:32.452 --> 00:58:33.646
Hello.


00:58:33.786 --> 00:58:35.560
<i>This is Piper Griffin.</i>


00:58:36.289 --> 00:58:38.689
