00:59:16.329 --> 00:59:17.362
No.


00:59:17.997 --> 00:59:20.362
No, no, no, no, Nico!


00:59:40.937 --> 00:59:42.256
Hello.


00:59:42.397 --> 00:59:45.172
Hi, uh, this is Lester
