01:01:29.420 --> 01:01:31.202
<i>Do not attempt
to leave your home.</i>


01:01:31.214 --> 01:01:33.534
Department of Sanitation! Open up!


01:01:33.675 --> 01:01:37.702
Now, where is that girl?


01:01:40.181 --> 01:01:43.002
