01:08:16.535 --> 01:08:18.400
Come on. Come on.


01:08:21.290 --> 01:08:23.155
Get out of the car, May.


01:08:23.292 --> 01:08:24.406
You wanna play?


01:08:25.795 --> 01:08:28.570
Please leave me alone! What?
You wanna play? Let's play!


01:08:28.714 --> 01:08:31.034
