Get out! Get out!


01:08:41.477 --> 01:08:42.796
Get out!


01:08:44.355 --> 01:08:46.095
I'll pull you right through!


01:08:47.900 --> 01:08:49.423
Get out!


01:08:53.864 --> 01:08:55.103
Tango is down.


01:08:55.241 --> 01:08:56.764
We're at bingo fuel.


01:08:57.284 --> 01:08:58.682
Recalling.


01:09:02.706 --> 01:09:05.356
We're going.
We're going home.


01:09:31.610 --> 01:09:33.384
Nice try.


01:09:34.530 --> 01:09:37.601
Take this off.
Get it off.


01:09:39.285 --> 01:09:42.481
Relax, breathe it in.
Breathe it in.


01:09:44.707 --> 01:09:46.981
