01:12:02.469 --> 01:12:04.038
I was a paralegal.


01:12:05.431 --> 01:12:07.296
I was putting myself
through law school.


01:12:08.100 --> 01:12:09.544
Oh.


01:12:09.685 --> 01:12:12.050
Well, I guess it didn't
work out for everybody.


01:12:13.272 --> 01:12:15.216
That's your problem, Nico.


01:12:16.233 --> 01:12:20.180
You don't seem
to understand how good


01:12:20.321 --> 01:12:23.517
