<i>She can barely...</i>


01:19:40.927 --> 01:19:43.577
<i>Lester. I hope
this finds you well, man.</i>


01:19:44.473 --> 01:19:45.962
<i>Sara says hi.</i>


01:19:47.601 --> 01:19:50.626
<i>It's been three months.
Feels like three years.</i>


01:19:53.273 --> 01:19:56.173
<i>And the air out here,
you wouldn't believe it.</i>


01:19:56.318 --> 01:19:57.557
<i>I can breathe again.</i>


01:19:59.529 --> 01:20:02.930
<i>I wanted to thank you
for helping us get out.</i>


01:20:03.074 --> 01:20:06.190
<i>And for helping a kid who
lost everything find a purpose.</i>


01:20:07.579 --> 01:20:10.604
<i>You know, I realize now
we weren't just delivering packages.</i>


01:20:10.749 --> 01:20:12.272
<i>We were delivering hope.</i>


01:20:14.377 --> 01:20:17.903
<i>Harland and Griffin were reportedly
selling illegal immunity bracelets</i>


01:20:18.048 --> 01:20:20.118
<i>to wealthy buyers
on the Westside.</i>


01:20:20.258 --> 01:20:22.207
<i>And in a stunning revelation,</i>


01:20:22.219 --> 01:20:24.709
<i>Griffin's own wife,
and a popular online streamer</i>


01:20:24.721 --> 01:20:25.994
<i>who had evidence of the crimes,</i>


01:20:26.139 --> 01:20:29.039
<i>worked together
to expose the conspiracy.</i>


01:20:31.102 --> 01:20:32.842
<i>Always hiding all your problems.</i>


01:20:32.979 --> 01:20:34.673
<i>You never try to solve them.</i>


01:20:34.815 --> 01:20:36.054
Mom?


01:20:36.191 --> 01:20:37.339
Yeah?


01:20:37.776 --> 01:20:38.844
Where's Marie?


01:20:39.319 --> 01:20:41.093
She went home to her family.


01:20:44.658 --> 01:20:46.728
<i>She can barely.</i>


01:20:48.620 --> 01:20:49.893
<i>Give it to me.</i>


01:20:50.038 --> 01:20:51.436
It's a good thing.


01:20:52.791 --> 01:20:54.110
<i>It's only ready.</i>


01:20:56.044 --> 01:20:57.488
<i>That I'm the only.</i>


01:20:57.629 --> 01:21:00.029
<i>These eyes
I see you.</i>


01:21:01.216 --> 01:21:03.991
<i>I hope that one day
we can open our doors,</i>


01:21:04.135 --> 01:21:05.374
<i>walk outside</i>


01:21:05.512 --> 01:21:07.957
<i>and get back
to the things we love.</i>


01:21:08.098 --> 01:21:12.295
<i>And you're
leaving me with the weight of the world.</i>


01:21:12.435 --> 01:21:14.630
<i>These eyes
I see you.</i>


01:21:14.771 --> 01:21:19.765
<i>And you're leaving me
with the weight of the world.</i>


01:21:22.237 --> 01:21:23.886
<i>Whoo!</i>


01:21:24.030 --> 01:21:26.646
Man, I have missed the ocean.
This is incredible!


01:21:29.911 --> 01:21:31.651
<i>Whoo-hoo!</i>


01:21:39.004 --> 01:21:41.745
<i>I don't know how many
packages we delivered together,</i>


01:21:42.632 --> 01:21:44.076
<i>but now I'm sending you one.</i>


01:21:45.677 --> 01:21:47.872
<i>But whatever you decide to do
with what's inside...</i>


01:21:49.180 --> 01:21:50.829
<i>...promise me one thing.</i>


01:21:52.225 --> 01:21:53.498
<i>Don't ever give up.</i>


01:22:15.206 --> 01:22:17.355
<i>These eyes
I see you.</i>


01:22:17.500 --> 01:22:20.400
<i>And you're leaving me.</i>


01:22:27.510 --> 01:22:31.332
<i>The weight of the world.</i>


01:22:52.285 --> 01:22:55.231
<i>Getting used to the dark.</i>


01:22:55.372 --> 01:22:58.739
<i>But losing track of who we are.</i>


01:22:58.875 --> 01:23:01.275
<i>You say I don't have to worry.</i>


01:23:01.419 --> 01:23:04.570
<i>Oh, even though
We're miles apart.</i>


01:23:05.674 --> 01:23:08.699
<i>Look at what we've become.</i>


01:23:08.843 --> 01:23:12.164
<i>We're breathing hate
Through our lungs</i>


01:23:12.305 --> 01:23:14.750
<i>I hope that
It's not contagious</i>


01:23:14.891 --> 01:23:17.962
<i>'Cause I can taste it
On my tongue.</i>


01:23:23.984 --> 01:23:26.133
<i>I can feel the tension.</i>


01:23:30.782 --> 01:23:32.931
<i>Building like a question.</i>


01:23:38.373 --> 01:23:41.569
<i>Chasin' a fire.</i>


01:23:41.710 --> 01:23:45.532
<i>Oh, nobody can put it out.</i>


01:23:45.672 --> 01:23:50.290
<i>We're put into cages
No one to save us now.</i>


01:23:51.386 --> 01:23:55.037
<i>Yeah, I know you're tired.</i>


01:23:55.181 --> 01:23:58.957
<i>Oh, but I know
You'll never break.</i>


01:23:59.102 --> 01:24:04.096
<i>We turned our whole kingdom
Into a prison now.</i>


01:24:04.232 --> 01:24:06.506
<i>And now we're breaking out.</i>


01:24:06.651 --> 01:24:09.051
<i>Is it safe? Are we free?</i>


01:24:09.195 --> 01:24:12.641
<i>Can't get rid of the memories.</i>


01:24:12.782 --> 01:24:15.147
<i>Making me feel like
I'm drowning</i>


01:24:15.285 --> 01:24:18.356
<i>'Cause it keeps playing
On repeat.</i>


01:24:19.497 --> 01:24:22.443
<i>I don't know how it ends.</i>


01:24:22.584 --> 01:24:25.826
<i>Our hearts are craving
For revenge.</i>


01:24:25.962 --> 01:24:28.532
<i>Imagine that it's not forever.</i>


01:24:28.673 --> 01:24:31.744
<i>Oh, and we get to start again.</i>


01:24:38.808 --> 01:24:42.004
<i>Chasin' a fire.</i>


01:24:42.145 --> 01:24:45.921
<i>Oh, nobody can put it out.</i>


01:24:46.066 --> 01:24:51.060
<i>We turned all our kingdom
Into a prison now.</i>


01:24:51.196 --> 01:24:54.267
<i>But now we're breaking out.</i>


